9. u2-la i-ra-ga-mu na-as2-hu 
#tr.ts: ula ira(g)gamu našḫu(m)
#tr.en: will not claim; (their complaint) is rejected.

10. a-sza-ar t,a3-bu#-szi-im ap-lu#-sa3 i-na-di-in 
#tr.ts: ašar ṭābušim aplu(s)sa ina(d)din
#tr.en: Wherever is satisfactory to her (Munawwirtum) may give her inheritance.

11. _dub_ ha-ar-mu#-um si2-ih-tum 
